---
// B9 — About (id="about"), rewritten 27 Aug (owner: "less a CV, more a
// short introduction") — the labelled SKILLSET/PERSON rows are gone; the
// same facts now read as three short paragraphs of introduction. The PM
// qualification still appears without its grade. The photograph is the
// owner's own (supersedes the P1 consent gate); 640px native — a sharper
// export can replace it under the same filename.
---

<section class="about g-ink" id="about">
  <div class="about-wrap">
    <div class="about-grid">
      <div class="about-copy">
        <p class="t-micro eyebrow">WHO YOU’D BE HIRING</p>
        <h2 class="t-h2">The engineer who runs the&nbsp;job.</h2>

        <p class="t-body about-body" data-rv>
          Most developers can’t run a project to time and budget. Most project managers
          can’t build. I do both — and it’s just me, which is the point: the person you meet on
          site is the person who designs, builds, and answers the phone.
        </p>

        <div class="about-more" data-rv>
          <p>
            Both halves are real: I’m a qualified Associate Project Manager with four
            years of projects where scope and deadlines were not negotiable, and I build
            full-stack — Supabase, Stripe, Three.js, shipped through GitHub and Vercel.
          </p>
          <p>
            The first visit is for listening — notebook and pen before a laptop. I work
            from Telford, and everywhere on the map below is within an&nbsp;hour.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="about-photo" data-rv>
        <figure class="about-frame">
          <img
            src="/images/talon-portrait.webp"
            width={640}
            height={360}
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
            alt="Talon Herring at a client table, notebook open, pen in hand."
          />
        </figure>
        <p class="about-caption t-mono">THE PERSON ACROSS THE TABLE<i>◆</i>TELFORD</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about {
    padding-block: 120px;
    /* the method/case ground language: cobalt washes through ink-deep —
       here the light sits behind the portrait and answers low-left */
    background:
      radial-gradient(900px 520px at 82% 30%, rgb(29 78 216 / 0.18), transparent 68%),
      radial-gradient(700px 400px at 46% 92%, rgb(29 78 216 / 0.07), transparent 72%),
      radial-gradient(800px 440px at 8% 10%, rgb(29 78 216 / 0.12), transparent 70%),
      var(--color-ink-deep);
  }
  .about-wrap {
    max-width: 1560px; /* matches faults/method/case/process */
    margin-inline: auto;
    padding-inline: 24px;
  }
  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 7fr) minmax(0, 5fr);
    gap: clamp(40px, 5vw, 96px);
    align-items: center;
  }

  .about-body {
    margin-top: 32px;
    font-size: 1.1875rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: rgb(245 247 249 / 0.78);
    max-width: 44em;
  }

  /* ---------- the introduction, continued ---------- */
  .about-more p {
    margin-top: 20px;
    font-size: 1.1875rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: rgb(245 247 249 / 0.78);
    max-width: 44em;
  }

  /* ---------- the portrait ---------- */
  .about-frame {
    margin: 0;
    border: 1px solid rgb(245 247 249 / 0.16);
    border-radius: 12px;
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow:
      0 40px 90px -30px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.6),
      0 12px 30px -12px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.5);
    transition: border-color 220ms var(--ease), box-shadow 220ms var(--ease);
  }
  .about-photo:hover .about-frame {
    border-color: rgb(77 124 255 / 0.45);
    box-shadow:
      0 40px 90px -30px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.7),
      0 0 40px -8px rgb(77 124 255 / 0.25);
  }
  .about-frame img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
  }
  .about-caption {
    margin-top: 16px;
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    color: rgb(245 247 249 / 0.55);
  }
  .about-caption i {
    font-style: normal;
    margin-inline: 12px;
    font-size: 0.625rem;
    vertical-align: 1px;
    color: rgb(77 124 255 / 0.7);
  }

  @media (max-width: 899.98px) {
    .about { padding-block: 96px; }
    .about-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 48px; }
    .about-more p { max-width: 34em; font-size: 1.0625rem; }
    .about-body { max-width: 34em; font-size: 1.0625rem; }
  }
</style>
